# A Planeswalker ({1}{U}{U}, Narset, Parter of Veils, 5 loyalty) resolves the
# same way a creature does: permanentEffect's Move to Battlefield already
# grants the entering loyalty counters (Game.Move's own ETB handling,
# game-state.md) regardless of what pushed the card there -- CastSpell is
# just its first caller that is not setup.state placing it directly.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 U
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
queue paygeneric U
castspell human 1
resolvestack
